/-!
# Fixed P506/L0 all-order symmetric-hyperbolic energy rate

One compact-box constant controls every commuted spatial word.  The forcing is
generated by the same mother-action coefficients; on action zero it is exactly
the all-order coefficient commutator.  No derivative-order-specific energy
mechanism or target regularity enters this module.
-/

